{%- comment -%}
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Snippet: aura-money
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Server-side twin of money() in assets/aura-cart.js: « 68 € », « 34,50 € »
  (French order, no « ,00 »), so the drawer reads the same before and after
  the cart script re-renders it, whatever the store's money format.

  @param {number} cents - amount in cents
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  unless cents == blank
    assign aura_amount = cents | money_without_currency | remove: ',00'
    echo aura_amount | append: ' €'
  endunless
-%}
